  "description": "<p><strong>Scenario:</strong> A proficient artisan adds 1d4 to their own tool check, at most once per turn. Bare self requires the option owner to be the actor making the roll, while tool.prof checks the roller's proficiency or expertise.</p><p><strong>Setup:</strong> Drag this Active Effect onto the actor who should own the External Reaction option. All changes use Override mode. Confirm the installed D&amp;D 5e tool identifier before use. Test the feature in a disposable world before adding it to a live character.</p>",
